@startuml
left to right direction
actor Operator
actor "Human reviewer" as Human
actor "Deep Agents runtime" as Runtime
actor GitHub
rectangle "Deep Agents Ticket Enhancer" {
  usecase "Poll ticket" as Poll
  usecase "Judge completeness" as Judge
  usecase "Draft missing content" as Draft
  usecase "Apply scoped write policy" as Scope
  usecase "Update ticket lifecycle" as Update
}
Operator --> Poll
Poll .> Judge : includes
Poll .> Draft : includes
Draft .> Scope : includes
Poll --> Update
Human --> Update : LGTM
Runtime --> Judge
Runtime --> Draft
GitHub --> Update
@enduml
